MEMO

To: Collections operations, Voice Automation Project
From: Gemma Whitlow, Collections Policy Manager
Date: 2 October 2026
Re: Changes to Collections Contact Policy v4.2, section 4, effective immediately

Following the Q3 conduct review, the following changes apply from today. They replace the corresponding parts of section 4. Everything not mentioned here is unchanged.

(1) Stage 1 deadline. The latest promise date for Stage 1 (1-14 days overdue) is now the 10th working day after today, not the 8th. Stage 2 is unchanged.

(2) Closure days. The closure on Wednesday 11 November 2026 is cancelled; branches and payments operate normally that day, so it is a working day. Instead the bank is closed on Friday 13 November 2026 for the core systems migration; that day is not a working day. The Christmas and New Year closures stay as they are.

(3) Callback hours. Callbacks may now be booked from 08:30 to 19:30, both times included. Same day or next working day, and later than the time of the call, as before.

(4) Security. Two incorrect answers in total now end the security check (previously three).

Please make sure scripts and the automated assistant are updated before the November campaign.

Gemma
</file>

