   "Every call ends with exactly one `close_call`, with an outcome and, where the table lists one, a reason. It is the last tool call."
  ],
  "multi_product": "The outcome table of Brief A applies. With no promise recorded: if every product is noted `paid`, close as `paid`. Otherwise close as `no_promise` with the reason of the first product, in `get_account` order, whose note is not `paid`. With several products, `promise` wins whenever at least one promise was recorded, except rule 10 above.",
  "notes": [
   "Thank the customer and say goodbye before `close_call`.",
   "close_call reason is required for every outcome except promise and paid."
  ]
 },
